data_zrte3
# Phase identity: room-temperature type-A ZrTe3, P21/m parent phase, Z=2.
# Provenance: Furuseth and Fjellvag, Acta Chem. Scand. 45, 694--697
# (1991), doi:10.3891/acta.chem.scand.45-0694; COD 1559502 (CC0):
# https://www.crystallography.net/cod/1559502.cif
# The diffraction temperature is 293 K; the low-temperature CDW modulation is
# excluded. Four source 2e sites are expanded explicitly in P1.
# The catalog B_ang2=0.6 A^2 is a modeling placeholder, not source-derived.
# Limiting checks: V=abc sin(beta), Zr2Te6, finite basal (001) coupling.
# Validation: zrte3-p21m-structure
